  {
    "id": 7,
    "date": "2026-08-28T02:41:31",
    "date_gmt": "2026-08-28T02:41:31",
    "guid": {
      "rendered": "https://minn-engine.localhost/?p=7"
    },
    "modified": "2026-08-28T02:41:31",
    "modified_gmt": "2026-08-28T02:41:31",
    "slug": "texturize-battery-its-quoted-fine",
    "status": "publish",
    "type": "post",
    "link": "http://127.0.0.1:8123/?p=7",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "Texturize battery: it&#8217;s &#8220;quoted&#8221; &#8212; fine"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">He said &#8220;hello there&#8221; and it&#8217;s fine. She replied &#8216;sure thing&#8217; at 6&#8217;2&#8243; tall.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Back in &#8217;99 we used dashes&#8212;like this&#8211;and spaced ones &#8212; too. Waiting&#8230; done.</p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>keep 'straight' \"quotes\" and ... dashes -- here</code></pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inline <code>it's \"kept\" raw...</code> but outside it&#8217;s curly again.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>He said &#8220;hello there&#8221; and it&#8217;s fine. She replied &#8216;sure thing&#8217; at 6&#8217;2&#8243; tall. Back in &#8217;99 we used dashes&#8212;like this&#8211;and spaced ones &#8212; too. Waiting&#8230; done. Inline it&#8217;s &#8220;kept&#8221; raw&#8230; but outside it&#8217;s curly again.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
